Z||000000||Scott||05-30-2001||02:36 PM||||I have a rebuilt duke (from an '84) with a new 4spd clutch & press. plate that I want to put into my '85 (SE Duke) w/ an Isuzu.  Will the 4 spd Muncie clutch work w/ the Isuzu trans?  BTW, I know that I have to put the '85 wiring harness on the rebuilt '84 motor.<BR>TIA  <p>[This message has been edited by Scott (edited 05-31-2001).]||||reg||1
